flowchart LR
    A[atacante] --> EVA{esquiva?<br/>evasion + 0.5 si DODGE}
    EVA -->|sí| MISS[0 daño]
    EVA -->|no| RAW[raw = max 1, atk - def]
    RAW --> BLOCK{bloqueo?}
    BLOCK -->|sí| RED[daño = max 1, raw * 1 - reducción]
    BLOCK -->|no| HIT[daño = raw]
    RED --> HP[HP clamp a 0]
    HIT --> HP
